            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Recoil"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "If a character forcefully presents Fulvia's ring to Xarwin's manifestation as an action with the manipulate trait, he must attempt a DC 26 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** Xarwin's manifestation is unaffected.\n- **Success:** Xarwin's manifestation takes 4d6 mental damage and is frightened 1.\n- **Failure:** Xarwin's manifestation takes 8d6 mental damage, is frightened 2, and flees as long as he remains frightened.\n- **Critical Failure:** Xarwin's manifestation is destroyed."
            },
            "id": "dc4578a9-6576-46c8-a447-179e5754afb7",
